From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] Waydroid: render host chrome from the live surface treatment

Android application pixels remain provider-owned and opaque.  The native
Waydroid HWC frame, however, is a Luma system surface and must follow the same
Light, Dark, Frost, and Glass authority as native applications.  Consume the
brokered effective treatment, preserve premultiplied ARGB throughout the
renderer, and redraw existing windows when that treatment changes.

--- a/hwcomposer/prairie-titlebar.cpp
+++ b/hwcomposer/prairie-titlebar.cpp
@@ -31,13 +31,49 @@
